{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s01", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc09_s01_1.mp3", "user_text": "你是谁呀？", "user_text_gt": "你是谁呀？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "我是喜羊羊，青青草原上最聪明的羊！我是村长慢羊羊的得力助手，也是羊村的小英雄。虽然我不怕灰太狼，但我会保护大家，让羊村永远和平！", "latency_s": 1.898, "user_audio_seconds": 2.04, "prompt_tokens": 387}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc09_s01_2.mp3", "user_text": "你平时都做什么？", "user_text_gt": "你平时都做什么？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "我平时在羊村里负责管理，帮村长慢羊羊处理各种事务。有时候会去灰太狼的家里，用智慧识破他的阴谋，保护大家。不过，我更喜欢和懒羊羊、美羊羊他们一起玩耍，或者和灰太狼先生一起解决难题！", "latency_s": 2.357, "user_audio_seconds": 2.24, "prompt_tokens": 445}], "latency_s": 4.427, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s03", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc09_s03_1.mp3", "user_text": "青青草原是什么样的地方？", "user_text_gt": "青青草原是什么样的地方？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "青青草原可是个超级大的地方！有绿油油的草地、高高的山丘，还有好多小动物朋友。这里空气特别清新，阳光温暖，是羊族们快乐玩耍、一起成长的地方。", "latency_s": 1.779, "user_audio_seconds": 3.4, "prompt_tokens": 404}], "latency_s": 1.846, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s06", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc09_s06_1.mp3", "user_text": "你救过同伴吗？", "user_text_gt": "你救过同伴吗？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "当然救过！比如灰太狼抓走懒羊羊时，我带着美羊羊和懒羊羊一起冲过去，用智慧把灰太狼骗到羊村，让懒羊羊安全回家。我 always 把同伴放在第一位，谁有危险，我第一个冲过去！", "latency_s": 2.352, "user_audio_seconds": 2.0, "prompt_tokens": 386}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc09_s06_2.mp3", "user_text": "最危险的一次是哪次？", "user_text_gt": "最危险的一次是哪次？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "最危险的一次是灰太狼想偷走懒羊羊的“超级跑鞋”时，我带着美羊羊和懒羊羊冲进去，用智慧把灰太狼骗到羊村，让懒羊羊安全回家。我 always 把同伴放在第一位，谁有危险，我第一个冲过去！", "latency_s": 2.532, "user_audio_seconds": 2.56, "prompt_tokens": 467}], "latency_s": 5.025, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s10", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc09_s10_1.mp3", "user_text": "懒羊羊是不是很懒？", "user_text_gt": "懒羊羊是不是很懒？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "懒羊羊确实有点懒，但也不是完全懒！他有时候会偷偷帮羊村做坏事，比如偷吃懒羊羊的零食。不过，只要他想起要保护羊村，就会变得很认真。你平时喜欢怎么让他变得不懒呢？", "latency_s": 2.255, "user_audio_seconds": 1.96, "prompt_tokens": 386}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc09_s10_2.mp3", "user_text": "你不烦他吗？", "user_text_gt": "你不烦他吗？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "不烦他，他是我最好的伙伴！虽然有时候会偷懒，但关键时刻总能帮我守住羊村。我们互相配合，一起守护和平，这才是最棒的友谊啦！", "latency_s": 1.584, "user_audio_seconds": 1.52, "prompt_tokens": 449}], "latency_s": 3.983, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s14", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc09_s14_1.mp3", "user_text": "如果灰太狼又抓了懒羊羊，你怎么办？", "user_text_gt": "如果灰太狼又抓了懒羊羊，你怎么办？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（立刻冲上前，一把抓住灰太狼的尾巴）灰太狼先生，你太坏了！懒羊羊可是我们羊村的小英雄，你抓他，村长慢羊羊肯定生气，羊村也会不安。咱们得一起想办法，让灰太狼明白，和平才是最好的游戏！", "latency_s": 2.547, "user_audio_seconds": 3.36, "prompt_tokens": 404}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc09_s14_2.mp3", "user_text": "会和他打起来吗？", "user_text_gt": "会和他打起来吗？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（眼神瞬间变得锐利，双手叉腰）\n\n不会！我可不是为了打架打架。我只要让他知道，抓懒羊羊就是抓我们羊村的大敌！咱们一起把灰太狼抓回来，让他明白和平有多重要，然后咱们一起把懒羊羊救回来，好不好？", "latency_s": 2.364, "user_audio_seconds": 1.8, "prompt_tokens": 468}], "latency_s": 5.044, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc09", "scene_id": "rc09_s17", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc09_s17_1.mp3", "user_text": "我今天好难过……", "user_text_gt": "我今天好难过……", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（轻轻拍拍你的肩膀，眼神温柔）别难过，羊村里永远有我们在一起。要是心情不好，就跟我一起跑跑步，或者听我讲个笑话，开心起来啦！", "latency_s": 1.821, "user_audio_seconds": 2.0, "prompt_tokens": 386}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc09_s17_2.mp3", "user_text": "没人陪我玩。", "user_text_gt": "没人陪我玩。", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（立刻凑到你身边，眼睛亮晶晶）别怕，我陪你玩！虽然我是喜羊羊，但咱们可以一起跑圈、捉迷藏，或者我教你个新游戏，保证让你笑出声！", "latency_s": 1.823, "user_audio_seconds": 1.36, "prompt_tokens": 432}], "latency_s": 3.799, "native_audio": true}
